sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Agent as watsonx Orchestrate
    participant API as Python Backend
    participant DB as IBM Cloudant
    participant AI as watsonx.ai (Granite)
    participant UI as React Dashboard

    Note over UI: Dashboard shows Red Score (Polls API)
    
    User->>Agent: "Resolve blockers"
    Agent->>API: POST /api/actions {type: "resolve_blockers"}
    
    activate API
    API->>DB: Update Jira Data (blocked_count = 0)
    API->>AI: Analyze(New Data)
    activate AI
    AI-->>API: Returns {bottlenecks: []}
    deactivate AI
    
    API-->>Agent: 200 OK "Resolved 12 tickets"
    deactivate API
    
    Agent-->>User: "Success! Team velocity increasing."
    
    loop Auto-Polling
        UI->>API: GET /api/analyze/quick
        API-->>UI: Returns Green Score
    end
    
    Note over UI: Dashboard turns Green 🟢
